# Not ours to format.
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
package-lock.json

# Tool-managed local state, not authored source. Claude Code rewrites `settings.local.json`
# itself, so a formatting gate over it would fail on a file no human edited.
.claude/

# Captured evidence: logs, screenshots, and a throwaway esbuild demo. Reformatting a log
# is meaningless and reformatting a capture changes the bytes that are the evidence.
.evidence/

# A live `GET /data.json` capture from a real LibreHardwareMonitor host. It is an artifact,
# not source: the test asserts over all 214 sensors in it, and its value is that it is
# byte-for-byte what the wire produced.
fixtures/lhm-data.sample.json

# Markdown is authored prose, hand-wrapped, with tables and diagrams laid out on purpose.
# Prettier would rewrite every one of them, including documents that are explicitly not this
# change's to touch (`SPEC.md`, `infra/`). If a documentation reformat is ever wanted it
# should be its own deliberate change, with the churn visible on its own.
*.md
